            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A 14-year-old girl was admitted to our hospital with peri-umbilical pain associated with obstipation and vomiting. Plain erect X-rays of the abdomen revealed multiple air fluid levels. A supine X-ray is shown in this figure.</AbstractText>
